# Ice Cauldron's {X} is paid with {R}{R}{R} from a Black Lotus and {B} from Mox Jet (X = 4) and exiles a Lightning Bolt from
# Bot1's hand - a Mountain there is no nonland card to choose. The ability puts a charge counter on it, so it can't be
# activated again (CR 602.5). Two turns later its mana ability adds exactly what was spent, {B}{R}{R}{R}, which may be spent
# only to cast that exiled Bolt (CR 106.6, 607.2a, 607.2e): the Bolt drawn since can't be cast with it (no other red source
# is left), the exiled one is cast from exile - the permission lasts while it stays there - with one {R} of it, and the rest
# stays in the pool.
